\n                    default: false,\n                    description: \"Whether to override the preferred input version for a field if it is empty and the other version isn't. Here 'empty' means undefined, null or an empty string.\",\n                    displayOptions: {\n                        show: {\n                            resolveClash: [{ _cnd: { not: 'addSuffix' } }],\n                        },\n                    },\n                },\n            ],\n        },\n    ]"
